    },
    {
      "title": "How It Works",
      "content": "DataSentinel formulates the fine-tuning of the detection LLM as a <strong>minimax optimization problem</strong>, which simulates a game between the detector and the attacker. The inner max problem optimizes the contaminated target data to evade detection, while the outer min problem fine-tunes the detection LLM to detect the contaminated target data.",
