      "title": "The Results",
      "content": "DataSentinel is evaluated on multiple benchmark datasets and LLMs, and it shows that it effectively detects both existing and adaptive prompt injection attacks. The results demonstrate that DataSentinel achieves a <strong>low false positive rate</strong> and a <strong>low false negative rate</strong> in detecting contaminated target data.",
